    "theorem": "BKUnipotentAudit.all_extension_boundary_certificate",
    "statement": "theorem all_extension_boundary_certificate : curve.Δ≠0 ∧ Nat.card curve.Point=9 ∧ Nat.card {P : geometricCurve.Point // (3:ℕ) • P=0}=9 ∧ Nat.Prime 3 ∧ Nat.Coprime 3 7 ∧ 3 ∣ 7-1 ∧ 3^2 ∣ Nat.card curve.Point ∧ TorsionBoundaryAudit.embeddingDegree 7 3=1 ∧ (∀ k : ℕ, (∀ P : geometricCurve.Point, (3:ℕ) • P=0 → sigma^[k] P=P) ↔ 3 ∣ k) ∧ (∀ k : ℕ, 3 ∣ 7^k-1) ∧ (∀ (A : Type) [Field A] [Fintype A] [Algebra F A] (ι : A →ₐ[F] K) (k : ℕ), Fintype.card A=7^k → (fullTorsionImage ι ↔ 3 ∣ k)) ∧ (∀ k : ℕ, 0<k → Nat.card (GaloisField 7 k)=7^k ∧ Nonempty (GaloisField 7 k →ₐ[F] K) ∧ ∀ ι : GaloisField 7 k →ₐ[F] K, fullTorsionImage ι ↔ 3 ∣ k) ∧ (∀ n : ℕ, Nonempty (GaloisField 7 (3*n+1) →ₐ[F] K) ∧ 3 ∣ 7^(3*n+1)-1 ∧ ∀ ι : GaloisField 7 (3*n+1) →ₐ[F] K, ¬fullTorsionImage ι)",
    "decl_sha256": "ad9e103939425245daae347385ac8cdc461f8e3313a2df01d1386deb199c62f3",
    "scope": "Actual nonsingular E/F7:y²=x³+3x+2 has #E(F7)=9 and geometric3torsioncard9. For every k, actual point Frobenius iterate fixes all3torsion iff3dividesk; cyclotomic3divides7^k-1 always and embeddingdegree1. Actual full geometric3torsion inclusion in every chosen field of cardinality7^k and every compatible embedding is iff3dividesk. GaloisField7k cardinality/existence/all-embedding criterion for every positivek; infinite actual image counterexamples in degrees3n+1. Literal division-quartic coordinate classification and small polynomial factors, actual Frobenius cube and actual nonfixed witness; arbitrary actual short-curve geometriccardinality used with explicit curve/discriminant checks. No generic torsion basis/determinant/Weil assumption. Confirms originalBK excluded-boundary mechanism, disproves deletingr not dividingq-1 evenr²#E; not a qualified source refutation, source own F19example remains distinct. Generic all-prime rank/determinant/Weil and complete all-extension census remain open. No native experiment or execution assurance.",
